  "entity.academy.card_grader_npc": "Card Grader NPC",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_no_card_1": "Ah, practicing the ancient art of pretend card holding, I see.",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_no_card_2": "That hand is looking mint! But I only grade cards.",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_no_card_3": "You know, maybe the rarest card of them all is the one we pretend to hold.",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_no_card_4": "No card for me? That’s alright, the real treasure is the trainer holding it.",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_no_card_5": "Looking to get something graded? Just hand me a card when you're ready.",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_no_card_6": "Got a favorite card? I’d be happy to take a look!",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_no_card_7": "I can’t grade empty hands, but I’ll gladly grade any card you bring.",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_card_1": "Ah, let me take a look at that beauty... This might take a while to appraise properly. Leave it with me.",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_card_2": "Oho! A fine specimen you’ve brought me. I’ll need some time to check its condition. Come back later.",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_card_3": "A fine choice! I’ll make sure it gets the grade it deserves. Check back in later.",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_broke_1": "Well, everything comes at a price... please gather the proper gold first.",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_broke_2": "This art may be ancient but my rent is very modern. Best secure the gold before we begin.",
  "text.academy.grader.initial_broke_3": "Grading is not free, you know. Even card masters have to eat. Bring the gold first.",
  "text.academy.grader.request_impatient_1": "Patience, patience... good grading takes time!",
  "text.academy.grader.request_impatient_2": "Come back later. The card is still being evaluated.",
  "text.academy.grader.request_impatient_3": "Careful work cannot be rushed. Trust me, you’ll want a proper grade.",
  "text.academy.grader.request_complete_1": "The evaluation is complete. I must say, this one surprised me...",
  "text.academy.grader.request_complete_2": "Ta-daaaa! One freshly graded card, hot out of the oven!",
  "text.academy.grader.request_complete_3": "All done! Thank you for waiting.",

